OL,3,AEl Salvador president says bodies found
OL,4,Ain Haiti are not those of hostages
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour bodies handed over to special
OL,7,Fforces on a mission to Haiti to recover
OL,8,FSalvadoran hostages are "not our men",
OL,9,FEl Salvador's president has said.
OL,11,FNayib Bukele said a nongovernmental
OL,12,Forganisation delivered the human
OL,13,Fremains to one of Haiti's airports
OL,14,Fclaiming they were four El Salvadoran
OL,15,Fair technicians, but that one of the
OL,16,Fcorpses was a child's and another was
OL,17,Fwearing a different country's army
OL,18,Funiform.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
