OL,3,AEl Salvador president says bodies found
OL,4,Ain Haiti are not those of hostages
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had dispatched a military
OL,7,Fcontingent, reportedly of hundreds of
OL,8,Fsoldiers, on Thursday after the four
OL,9,Fmen vanished after being ambushed by
OL,10,F"heavily armed criminal groups".
OL,12,FThe hostages had been part of the
OL,13,FUN-backed Gang Suppression Force (GSF),
OL,14,Fwhich is tasked with tackling worsening
OL,15,Fgang violence in Haiti.
